usage: research_records.py [-h] {init,append,export} ...

Local anonymous study records; no recruitment, bank access or research
conclusions.

positional arguments:
  {init,append,export}
    init                Create an empty owned anonymous study directory
    append              Append explicit operator-provided anonymous input
    export              Export all 3 x 6 opportunities; exclude withdrawn
                        records

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
